    "solution_steps": [
      "Use the substitution u = x², so du = 2x dx and x dx = du/2.",
      "When x = 0, u = 0; when x = 1, u = 1.",
      "The integral becomes (1/2) ∫₀¹ eᵘ du = (1/2)[eᵘ]₀¹.",
      "Result: (e − 1) / 2."
